  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enterprise Development Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centro de Investigacin y Promocin Social &quot;Sara Lafosse&quot; (CIPS &quot;Sara Lafosse&quot;), in cooperation with associations of dairy farmers and fishers and by training new entrepreneurs, expects to increase the incomes of 200 families in the communities of Huanquito Bajo and El Carmelo, in the district of Vir, La Libertad. It will also promote cooperation among the 22 public and private entities in the Association for the Joint Discussion of Local Development of the Coastal River Basins of the Libertad Region (AMEDIVAC), which will actively support the project.</narrative>
  </description>
